    "derivation": "The d=8 barycentric moment identity gives mean gap G/9 and the weighted affine mean ((sum factor)+(sum gap*factor)/G)/10. The original eighth-saving density contributes exactly 4 times the gap divided by two residual and eight coordinate factors. Physical simplex volume is abs(det(edgeMatrix))/8!; no Chen quarter or ordering factorial is inserted."
